From 9f4bacf21cd08494163b9a5b11531468d233ac0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yomathnotcool <125728853+DengZhiyuan-math@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:59:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: a Pursue's structure turns add up across its Reader
 and every Theorem (#19)

The shared budget keeps `structure_spent` beside `spent`: the Reader's turn and each finished Coordinator's Decomposer
turns. A Coordinator notes it at Start (`structure_before`) and its view says `pursue_structure_turns`, the Pursue's
structure turns so far, as `pursue_turns` says its turns. A page reads the count after the Pursue has ended too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/proof_agents/coordinator.py | 23 +++++++++++++++++------
 tests/test_pursue_budget.py     | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/proof_agents/coordinator.py b/src/proof_agents/coordinator.py
